Q: If you cannot access the internet or are not allowed to use the internet due to a security policy, what can you use to look up information?

Options:
 (A). paper;
 (B). cell phone;
 (C). television;
 (D). books;
 (E). encyclopedia;
 (F). library;
 (G). encyclopedia;
 (H). google;
A: If you cannot access the internet or are not allowed to use the internet due to a security policy, you can use (A) paper, (C) television, (F) library, and (G) encyclopedia to look up information.

